;
 Crystals were removed from the crystallisation vial and immediately coated
 with PDMS (polydimethylsiloxane/Dimethicone, CAS: 9006-65-9 on a glass slide.
 A suitable single crystal was selected and mounted on a glass fiber using
 vacuum silicone grease as adhesive. The glass fiber with single crystal was
 mounted on copper pin with solid paraffin. Operator: DJ_Tokyo.
;
